    <string name="settings_mqtt_help">The tablet announces itself: in Gladys, Integrations → MQTT → discovered devices (Home Assistant), add “DomoWallDock …”. You get battery, charging, motion, the screen (on, off) and two buttons (reload, back to the dashboard). Also works with any MQTT broker that understands Home Assistant discovery.</string>
