    <string name="settings_charge_enable">Manage charging (tablet always plugged in)</string>
    <string name="settings_charge_help" formatted="false">A battery kept at 100 % all the time wears out and can swell. DomoWallDock cannot cut charging itself (Android forbids it): it publishes a “Charge wanted” sensor over MQTT, and a Gladys scene turns the charger’s smart plug on or off. If the tablet drops off the network, “Charge wanted” goes back to “yes” by itself so the battery does not run flat.</string>
